        "short_description": "Placeholder for a twelve-team head-to-head fantasy league in any sport: two divisions of six, weekly matchups, a playoff bracket. Onboarding sets the real sport, renames everything, and links both the fantasy app and the sport pack."
      },
      "lore": [
        {
          "title": "Structure",
          "content": "Twelve placeholder fantasy teams in Division East and Division West (tags division-east, division-west), one weekly head-to-head matchup each round, a playoff bracket for the top teams at the end. Onboarding must: set sport to the real sport's code on the competition (the fantasy league scores real players from that sport) and tag it with that code and fantasy; set scoring_system from the sport pack's Fantasy chunk (standard, half_ppr, ppr, categories, points...) and write the league's scoring table and roster settings in a lore chunk titled House rules; create the APPLIES_TO edge from the real sport's rule/sport_<code> to this competition (the edge from rule/app_fantasy is seeded); rename the competition and each Team N to the managers' team names; create each manager as a person with primary_role fantasy_manager and a STAFF_OF edge with role owner; and create the current season with a COMPETES_IN edge per team carrying group Division East or Division West.",
          "display_index": 0
        }
      ]
